-- Crabe skill-tree patch. Plain Lua, run against the ProgressionTable
-- global right after gamedb/core/in2_avg_hulk.lua sets it -- only touches
-- the fields listed here, nothing else needs extracting/maintaining.
--
-- HULK_BASEHEALTH is both the filename/match hint and one of the table keys
-- already in the original file, so it's guaranteed to appear in the
-- compiled bytecode being matched against (see skilltrees/README.md).

ProgressionTable.BaseValues.HULK_BASEHEALTH.Value = 100000

-- Same syntax reaches ability/move nodes, not just BaseValues -- this is
-- how you'd give a character an existing ranged attack, uncomment and point
-- at real Upgrades.* fields once you know which ones you want (see
-- Crabe.inspect / the decompiled file for the full key list):
